{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Rust 原生导航决策 C ABI 的跨端语义向量；每项均绑定 session/tab/generation/origin/path+query/scope/nonce。 审计第六轮（2026-10-03/04）补入 deny-by-content 与高危目标（本机/私网）require_confirmation 向量——此前本文件只覆盖 url_policy/session_not_found 两类拒绝，\"黑名单匹配\"与\"确认只对高危触发\"均无跨端锁定。 第八轮 B9（2026-10-06）：回环/RFC1918/localhost 由 require_confirmation 改为 allow——第七轮 B8 裁决落进核心；确认流域示例改挂云元数据/链路本地/文档段。",
  "vectors": [
    {
      "name": "canonical_url_fragment_and_replay",
      "register_session": true,
      "generation": 0,
      "url": "HTTPS://Example.COM:443/path?query=1#request",
      "scope": "navigation",
      "expected_evaluate": "allow",
      "expected_origin": "https://example.com",
      "expected_parameters": "/path?query=1",
      "consume_url": "https://example.com/path?query=1#execute",
      "consume_scope": "navigation",
      "expected_consume": "allow",
      "expected_replay_code": "nonce_replay"
    },
    {
      "name": "unknown_session_fails_closed",
      "register_session": false,
      "generation": 0,
      "url": "https://example.com/known",
      "scope": "navigation",
      "expected_evaluate": "deny",
      "expected_deny_code": "session_not_found"
    },
    {
      "name": "invalid_scheme_fails_closed",
      "register_session": true,
      "generation": 0,
      "url": "javascript:alert(1)",
      "scope": "navigation",
      "expected_evaluate": "deny",
      "expected_deny_code": "url_policy"
    },
    {
      "name": "scope_change_invalidates_authorization",
      "register_session": true,
      "generation": 0,
      "url": "http://example.com:8080/export?format=json",
      "scope": "navigation",
      "expected_evaluate": "allow",
      "expected_origin": "http://example.com:8080",
      "expected_parameters": "/export?format=json",
      "consume_url": "http://example.com:8080/export?format=json",
      "consume_scope": "download",
      "expected_consume": "deny",
      "expected_consume_code": "action_binding_mismatch"
    },
    {
      "name": "generation_advance_invalidates_pending_action",
      "register_session": true,
      "generation": 0,
      "url": "https://example.com/gen-bound",
      "scope": "navigation",
      "expected_evaluate": "allow",
      "expected_origin": "https://example.com",
      "expected_parameters": "/gen-bound",
      "consume_url": "https://example.com/gen-bound",
      "consume_scope": "navigation",
      "expected_consume": "allow",
      "advance_generation": true,
      "expected_reconsume_code": "action_not_issued",
      "note": "PY-092 代际推进后旧 action 消费拒绝（action_not_issued——上下文按代际寻址，旧代际 action 不再可达）"
    },
    {
      "name": "session_destroyed_fails_closed_at_consume",
      "register_session": true,
      "generation": 0,
      "url": "https://example.com/destroyed",
      "scope": "navigation",
      "expected_evaluate": "allow",
      "expected_origin": "https://example.com",
      "expected_parameters": "/destroyed",
      "consume_url": "https://example.com/destroyed",
      "consume_scope": "navigation",
      "expected_consume": "allow",
      "destroy_session": true,
      "expected_reconsume_code": "action_not_issued",
      "note": "PY-091 KillSwitch 等价语义：会话销毁后消费点 fail-closed（action_not_issued——上下文已销毁，action 不可达；native core 无 KillSwitch 注入口——C# broker 层能力）"
    },
